+# AmigaOS 3 (gfamigakicad): static libraries only, kifaces linked into
+# the programs, no Python, OpenCASCADE, OpenGL or webview yet.
+option( KICAD_AMIGA
+    "Build for AmigaOS 3 on the GFOpenWX Toolkit (default OFF)"
